'''{{D|Ragdoll}}''' is a [[Status Effect]]/physics state that causes enemies to be [[wikipedia:Ragdoll physics|ragdolled]]. During this state, enemies cannot move, attack or perform any actions, and become susceptible to [[Finisher|ground finisher]] attacks.

* Enemies which are immune to (complete) crowd control are also immune to being ragdolled. These include [[bosses]], [[Acolytes]], and units protected by [[Overguard]].
* Enemies that remain in ragdoll for an extended amount of time (excluding sources of slow that decrease enemy animation speed, such as {{A|Gloom}} or {{A|Rhino Stomp}}) are instantly killed after some time. This is to prevent potentially bugged enemies from taking up the enemy spawn pool.

